              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A border? (सीमा, sīmā.) A region? (प्रदेश, pradeś.) A capital city? (राजधानी, rājdhānī.) A suburb? (उपनगर, upnagar.) Up? (वरती, varatī.) Certainly? (नक्की, nakkī.) Really? (खरोखर, kharokhar.) Almost? (जवळजवळ, javaḷjavaḷ.) About? (सुमारे, sumāre.) Only? (फक्त, phakta.) Serious? (गंभीर, gambhīr.) Shy? (लाजाळू, lājāḷū.) Valiant? (शूर, śūr.) Fearful? (भित्रा / भित्री, bhitrā / bhitrī.) Curious? (उत्सुक, utsuk.) Free of charge? (मोफत, mophat.) Modern? (आधुनिक, ādhunik.) Ancient? (प्राचीन, prācīn.) Cooked? (शिजलेला, śijlelā.) Ripe? (पिकलेला, piklelā.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
